  "body_html": "<p>It seems like the UK is gaining lead in our Band Of The Week contest. The weekend in the second week of our Band Of The Week contest are Radio Radio – a young rock band heading from South London!</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/radioradio.jpg\"><img alt=\"radioradio\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4097\" height=\"477\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/radioradio.jpg\" width=\"636\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/traffic.jpg\"><img alt=\"traffic\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4101\" height=\"547\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/traffic.jpg\" width=\"166\"/></a></p>\n<p>Congratulations, guys! Can’t wait to talk to you and ask you this and that…</p>\n<p>Expect our interview and extensive feature on Radio Radio in the upcoming week! Until then vote for our new bands competing in the right of this article or submit your band to the contest on the left.</p>",
